Inside $[19, 2019]$:

- multiples of $20$: $20, 40, \ldots, 2000$ — that is $100$ numbers;
- multiples of $19$: $19, 38, \ldots, 2014 = 19 \times 106$ — that is $106$ numbers;
- multiples of both, i.e. of $380$: $380, 760, 1140, 1520, 1900$ — that is $5$ numbers.

$$100 + 106 - 5 = 201.$$

Answer **A**.
